@node REGISTRATION "Registration information"
                         @{u}Registration information@{uu}

@{u}Why register???@{uu}

If you register you will get :

 @{b}o@{ub} A personal version of PrO-DmScHeCk
 @{b}o@{ub} Your BBS number appearing at the bottom of track zero's
 @{b}o@{ub} Optionally the upload date and/or time can be added to the banners.
 @{b}o@{ub} At least one update to PrO-DmScHeCk
 @{b}o@{ub} A disk containing unregistered versions of my other Ami-Express doors,
         with the registered version of PrO-DmScHeCk


@{u}How much is it to register ?@{uu}

Registration is £5.00 (Five UK pounds)

@{u}How do I register then ?@{uu}

Print out (or write by hand) the file '@{i}Register.doc@{ui}' and mail it to me
(see @{"contacting me" link CONTACTING_ME}), along with the 5 pounds in @{b}CASH@{ub}, and you will recieve
the latest registered version via return of post.... if your BBS is in
the UK then I will personally call and upload the latest version.
@endnode

